Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:11.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:18.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:24.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:30.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:47.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:54.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:01:00.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:13.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:24.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先是不小心得了感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着又为草太的恋情奔波
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然前前后后花了不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总算和犬夜叉一起又回到了战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.28,0:01:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见啦 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就走咯 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:02:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第91话 怪异的巫师和黑色云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在总算可以定下心来寻找奈落的行踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.93,0:02:09.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近这段时间一直在忙一些无聊事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:11.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家感冒得那么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不过是件无聊事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉…真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛要胡说八道自讨苦吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿他没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次说过 奈落是往丑寅方向溜走的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这个地方看过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是那边才对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家不要拖拖拉拉的了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧赶路 走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 这次一定要抓到你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要走那么快啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位村民
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大神再度降下旨意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫会给全村带来不幸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫指的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说猫如果有两条尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就代表拥有妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:08.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果大家不把这只叉尾猫赶出村外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里一定会大祸临头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下 下次别再让我看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死叉尾猫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要跑去哪里啊？云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 真是清爽啊 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱的女生哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是听见这个女生 的叫声所以跑来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 原来你跑到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我担心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你太好了 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.11,0:04:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫不叫作小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的名字叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我帮你戴铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是珊瑚养的爱猫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 铃铛戴好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么跟我回家吧 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不叫作小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家又过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点跑吧 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 千万不能被他们抓到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说了她叫云母嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然长得可爱 但是是个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们看 就是那只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明应该被我们赶到村外去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死猫 快滚 你这只死猫 快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 住手 你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚 痛死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在人面前不要随便变身啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个家伙 难道跟猫怪是一伙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁是猫怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别发火 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事交给我来处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位叔叔伯伯 动用暴力是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果好好坐下来谈一定可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些该死的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别生气别生气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 冷静一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.03,0:06:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能再做这种 粗暴的事下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说 九命怪猫有仇记七世的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这只猫并不是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村民们对你们这么没礼貌实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没什么关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过话又说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的村民 怎么会这么讨厌一只小猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那个小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她那么喜欢云母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是个心地善良的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:44.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里有一只很聪明的小猫叫小花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们全都跟她感情非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到几天前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个云游各地很厉害的巫师来到我们村子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟全村的人说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫将会给村民们带来不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们马上把她赶出村子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得刚刚那个小姑娘会把云母当成小花呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我知道这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很对不起村里的小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是大家都怕村子真的发生了什么不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.11,0:07:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一只猫就能够带来灾难这种说法…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个巫师有点可疑耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们有必要会会他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会太久没有吃过好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下吃太多吃坏肚子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道要去哪里才能找到刚刚那位小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是刚刚那位小姑娘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:56.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:07:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚被你戴上铃铛的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你走丢的那只小花
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是另一只猫 叫做云母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在找一只叫做小花的猫对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我陪你一起找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅？好好听的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（念咒声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 七宝这家伙跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得他有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是妖气漂浮聚集而形成的云
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这个巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真不是个简单的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作得快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚村长说他应该 就在村子尽头的小庙里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:18.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来应该不在这边喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很喜欢那只猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花肚子里已经怀了小宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:48.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会帮你把小花找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再往里面找找看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 这股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快抓紧我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要逃到更高的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是老鼠 成群结队的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶紧求菩萨保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个村子都是些愚不可及的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后这个村子不会再有我们最怕的猫了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然叉尾猫不在这
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我的老鼠兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会抢光整个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着吃光整个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快要跑不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 她就是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道它也有两条尾巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 你来救我的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是利用妖气创造出来的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个巫师应该是妖怪变身的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界我一刀就把你打烂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身啦 你这只笨鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该是个半妖吧 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然也敢跟我铁鼠大爷作对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是猫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长得人高马大 居然会怕一只猫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才要赶走小朋友所喜欢的猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只可恶的老鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷这就来收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是一只专说大话的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢呵呵 你这只半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就这么点本事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说风之伤也收拾不了他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？终于知道害怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本不是妖怪的原形
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:26.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是鼠辈的妖气集结起来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你用刀砍他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕都不见得有用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.35,0:13:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来收拾他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要使出风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气吸光这些鼠辈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得小花想要带我们去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小宝宝都平安没事耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起回村子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后谁都不能再把我们分开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻到了闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类小孩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果吃了这些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们老鼠怪的妖力马上可以增强一倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 别追出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候追出去恐怕会有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外头让小花应付就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:14:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮她保护好孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙 你就非死缠着本大爷是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 你千万不可以离开这里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷今天就要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿呀 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真棒耶 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝我的铁鼠幻术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过出口好像被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会想办法救你们出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边应该就是出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是死不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只可恶的老鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就这样怕了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃离这个村子了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠怪好不容易才把这个村的猫赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他不会那么容易放弃这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…它还在村子附近活动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:19.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:21.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么那只叉尾猫又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…快点找…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:31.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是 七宝带在身上的铃铛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 难道这只猫就是小花了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子好像受伤不轻耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫看起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像想带我们去什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸…好难受…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快要可以出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:12.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再忍耐一下 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一下下就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要撑下去 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:25.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要撑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是妖怪吧 快点让开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面一定有人类的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小孩我今天吃定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会让你称心如意的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他脸上没有小花抓的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然靠吃人类小孩来增加妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事亏你做得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了你那把剑根本奈何不了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他脸上没有被小花抓过的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 看看后面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击那块岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你的原形在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花她…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:20.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己身上受了伤都不顾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼命想把你们的消息传给我们知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们大家 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢… 你们的大恩大德救了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 保重哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小朋友们 吃饭时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我们一定要一直在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你好像很卖力哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅全都说给我们听了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:35.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 男子汉大丈夫本来就应该保护女生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最伟大的是连一点私心都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想把这句话说给某人听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你其实是喜欢上那个叫小梅的姑娘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实就是这么回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你生气的话 那就是欲盖弥彰喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉你又欺负我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:21:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:06.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又怎么了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.74,0:22:19.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:29.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:39.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.37,0:22:49.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:53.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:58.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:06.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:12.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.11,0:23:17.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:24.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:34.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.81,0:23:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有里陶用的那些药草的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的里陶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个让桔梗复活的妖婆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到桔梗留下的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:24:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…桔梗她控制了里陶那些部队了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还有利用人的魂魄制作陶俑这种事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.49,0:24:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复活者的野心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说里陶到现在还没死
